{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "feec7096-9dcf-8d58-bbc1-6aff8b46a33e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T11:19:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colin Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:17:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:17:05-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. Colin Cullen here. You know, I grew up down by the harbor, and when I was a kid the trash guys used to wave at us from the back of the truck. Anyway, that's not why I'm calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:17:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What can I do for you, Mr. Cullen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:17:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My recycling bin is gone. They came for the pickup this morning, and after they left I went out to get the bin and it wasn't there. Not in the street, not down the road either."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:17:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the bin went missing after this morning's pickup. Can I get the address where it was?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:17:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "184 Old Beach Road. Over on the Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:17:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "184 Old Beach Road, got it. And is it the recycling bin, not the trash barrel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:17:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recycling. The blue one with the lid."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:17:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, blue recycling bin with a lid. Did you check with a neighbor, in case the wind carried it or it got picked up with the wrong house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:18:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I walked up and down a bit. Nothing. I'm home today, so I've got the time, I'm just sitting here rewatching an old sitcom for the fifth time. Figured I'd make the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good use of a Tuesday. So to get a replacement, I'll put in a request with our department. Can I have a phone number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:18:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0182."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:18:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0182. Let me read that back. Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight two. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:18:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:18:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So I have a missing blue recycling bin at 184 Old Beach Road, reported Tuesday after the morning pickup, and you need a replacement. Someone will deliver it or call you if they have questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:18:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is there anything I need to do in the meantime? Like, do I put recycling out in something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:18:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Until the new one comes, you can hold onto it inside, or use a sturdy container and mark it recycling. Just hang on to it till the replacement shows up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:19:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, that works. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:19:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Cullen. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
